── CATCH-ALL WITHOUT A REASON ── W0501_catch_all_without_a_reason.lt:5:52  [W0501]

This arm catches every error and drops it, so it raises again, uses the error or
gives a reason: `because "…"`:

  5 │ fn count(text: str) -> i64 { try parse(text) catch _ => 0 }
    │                                                    ^

An arm that drops every error hides failures. Raise the error again, use it, or
say why dropping it is right, as `catch _ because "…" => …`.
